6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Sy0QPncM1f8Q7kNvwGVK820&_nc_oc=AdmoLJtuLDPAh2ptUNycW0TtZBKKJ1xtIv3ddNBlzQJWN3GltVP3Yelvojl6oPLtyhA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz_ybbRK6_4tXZSFwwlcxH3zba72KeE4RN_XKpDBneBdA&oe=69AEABC4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "image_026_0000.png", "id": "1663884603977026", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75451777_1663884610643692_5999330319497865154_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s2JW2LIsYFUQ7kNvwEZV9Si&_nc_oc=Adk96D-QVju2TS-dITEC508xBs8w_abDRFpN5izQnpyD0BzfS7xmSTR_E4yoByUhsu0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwfb1jjR2tA0oc2Rh9OgP9edjqFqz4oY2NTYSf6LhE-UQ&oe=69AEA9CA"}, "display_name": "Virtual Chess", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Play chess with your friends, with random people online or against the computer in a beautiful VR environment.\n\nThe game supports many different platforms - VR, smart phones, tablets, smart TVs, so you can play with your friends even if they don't use a VR headset.\n\nThere are also many online players that you can play with and the rating algorithm will make sure that you're matched with opponents of a similar strength, so you can always enjoy an interesting and competitive game.\n\nThe game has many different features besides the standard chess gameplay, including:\n- tens of thousands of interesting puzzles, where you need to find a possible checkmate within 1, 2 or 3 moves.\n- ability to analyze your games and see where you made mistakes, what better moves you could have played, what was the balance (your winning chances) at each move, etc.\n- you can optionally create an account and maintain your progress across multiple devices\n- and many others!\n\nWe hope you like it!", "short_description": "Play chess with your friends, with random people online or against the computer in a beautiful VR environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ches